@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>.
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>.
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>.
@prefix omnfed: <http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn-federation#>.

<http://alex.willner.ws/about#me> a <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Person>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn#Group> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>.
<http://open-multinet.info/ontology/omn-federation> <http://creativecommons.org/ns#license> <http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>;
                                                    <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/contributor> <mailto:jorge.lopez_vergara@uam.es>,
                                                                                                  <http://www.commit-nl.nl/people/morsey>,
